OL,3,GNEWSAResort revs up for vintage beach
OL,4,Arace
OL,5,
OL,6,FA festival featuring vintage vehicles
OL,7,Fracing along a beach is returning.
OL,9,FRace the Waves, which is taking place
OL,10,Fin Bridlington, is a tribute to the
OL,11,Fpast when beaches in Yorkshire were
OL,12,Fused for land speed record attempts.
OL,14,FIt features an array of vintage
OL,15,FEuropean and American vehicles and
OL,16,Fmotorcycles racing along a 200-yard
OL,17,Fstretch.
OL,19,FThe internationally recognised event
OL,20,Ftakes place from Thursday 10 to Sunday
OL,21,F13 September and is free to attend.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
